{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "037jir_302_2_3_037_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:bc084e41e66ba0487e71997197a05b396818f0682500727c65d943466e579243",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:037jir_302_2_3_037_02_09_a:2_3_037_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c522fa4cc086c36b266ffe0a916767383e25593bb1c9e7d5d0511f6156dbb054",
      "text": "喂喂，制作人酱。\n那个圣诞节节目终于要播出了呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_302_2_3_037_02_09_a:2_3_037_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e2aade4cf4ee9496333c3c9ad231cb985611e070f65a0cad571215c09866502",
      "text": "我记得说是在事务所看也可以来着。\n那帮人有谁说要过来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_302_2_3_037_02_09_a:2_3_037_02_09_a:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56da763246a0d4c0d2ecf66fe59766090eb7bf3073bba9ac9b97c5355186a026",
      "text": "是的。听说会来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_302_2_3_037_02_09_a:2_3_037_02_09_a:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf45ad314dfed4c38f8211a97b62b9283fc1dcef7e4d892712e86b0eb1ba7df6",
      "text": "听说大家都会聚在一起",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_302_2_3_037_02_09_a:2_3_037_02_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:352c96c323e28015c7416e50334729e014c4f173a7178ae48977fa364d9c5a6c",
      "text": "这样啊～。\n那大叔我也露个面吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_302_2_3_037_02_09_a:2_3_037_02_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51dc274009bd1026476ffe0939c759245ae02a4b79b7fa3fbbc3f8a417042a20",
      "text": "啊～，这么说来那个录像也要大家一起看啊。\n这未免有点……怪不好意思的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_302_2_3_037_02_09_a:2_3_037_02_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6877214da6bfc20890e9b21020d4aef3cd2ecc804cbc0e24650b56222a92c41",
      "text": "大叔我啊，就因为是圣诞约会，\n还破天荒地装模作样耍了回帅呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_302_2_3_037_02_09_a:2_3_037_02_09_a:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3ed25b3be7792b1c531ff0deff2657660094e8137a4b45a96281558b1c368e6",
      "text": "非常帅气哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_302_2_3_037_02_09_a:2_3_037_02_09_a:cmd-000022:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a8bb4c3686f688f40ebe909eebbf3b7fdbdc57cd65d8716b6d9684afaaad68b",
      "text": "和平时不同的一面，\n也非常棒！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_302_2_3_037_02_09_a:2_3_037_02_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c33f42bc7b110118f075e7726391cdf09d8039b881ab252c32b935367477619",
      "text": "……是、是吗？虽然被夸了我也拿不出什么奖励，\n不过这时候就老老实实收下夸奖吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_302_2_3_037_02_09_a:2_3_037_02_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dea353832d4087cc87e919d31ffa2045378f1b420b97a9da171b5f7513890cf",
      "text": "嘛，不好意思的心情大家也都一样吧。\n真怀念啊，各自的圣诞约会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_302_2_3_037_02_09_a:2_3_037_02_09_a:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acdb172d2efb22403985fbc9a2110d07c0779ccf8f1d64c9a39764d879343721",
      "text": "能窥见大家全新一面的工作，\n真是不错呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_302_2_3_037_02_09_a:2_3_037_02_09_a:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae2e0094f1e78d092c7ec5b8889daaa8f0b48d063abc8af84077c9d9b5b70e91",
      "text": "大家能再聚在一起感觉也挺好玩的，\n就热热闹闹地一边聊一边看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_302_2_3_037_02_09_a:2_3_037_02_09_a:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8100dbaaba01c8cc7421b8e29c106f5d95d4ed6d85e6beb6c54940b5fa7e164",
      "text": "那就这样啦。当天我会去事务所的，拜托你咯，\n●●●●プロデューサー酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
